# ===== CoinDrop Rewards — Client Environment Variables =====
# Copy this file to ".env" in client/ for local overrides (optional).
# In production (Vercel), set this as a real Environment Variable in
# the project's Settings → Environment Variables — Vite bakes it into
# the build at BUILD TIME, so any change here requires a redeploy.

# Production:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://coindrop-rewards-api-new.onrender.com/api

# Local development (only needed if you don't want the automatic
# localhost fallback already built into src/api/axios.js):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
